    ],
    "macos_bundle": [
      "org.audacityteam.audacity"
    ],
    "window_title": []
  },
  "sources": [
    "https://manual.audacityteam.org/man/keyboard_shortcut_reference.html"
  ],
  "note": "Only the default 'Standard' keyboard shortcut set is included, per the manual; the extended 'Full' set (the shortcuts available in Audacity 2.1.3 and earlier) is disabled by default and is not included. Mac chords follow the manual's stated substitution rule (Ctrl -> Cmd/⌘, Alt -> Option) except where the manual documents a different Mac shortcut: 'Add Label at Playback Position' is Cmd+. and 'Preferences' is Cmd+, on Mac. 'Toggle/Select Numpad Enter' and mouse-driven items (Command-click the checkbox, drag gestures) are not documented on this page and are not included.",
